    Follow-up H-1795551682-b28e: preserve all observed budget liability
    
    Keep independent token/CPU/cost maxima in merge_usage_snapshots instead of
    losing the non-winning input's CPU/cost. Preserve measured debt when entering
    held (including an unpersisted overrun snapshot) and tighten legacy holds on
    reconcile. Initialise cpu baseline and prior meter at finalize entry, extend
    wall liability through verified stop, and hold conservatively whenever the
    current agent native_session_id differs from or is missing the pinned identity
    at stop, monitor or reconcile. Add deterministic mock regressions; strengthen
    the lifecycle failed-stop fixture to require retained overrun debt.
    
    No cap, config, permit, source-restriction or tool changes; no live dispatch.

